# Build trees and fetched data. Corpora, papers, audio and page renders run to about
# 1.9 GB and every one of them is reproducible from the tools in this repository, so
# none of it is carried in git.
build/
build-*/

# The rendered site. mkdocs build writes it and the GitHub Action rebuilds it on every push, so a
# copy in git is one that goes stale the moment a page changes.
site/

# The hand extractions. Every row is a form transcribed out of a published paper, so the tables are
# those papers' text and not this work's to redistribute. The derivations built on them are this
# work's and stay in the repository: the ledger, the bound, the checks and the code are all here.
# The tables are held outside git and go to anyone who has the papers and asks.
*.oracle.tsv

# Python caches. The tools here are run directly and cache next to themselves.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Editor and OS leavings.
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
